Program (C&I) and Federal Depository Library Program (FDLP).  aThe Annual Integrated Economic Survey (AIES) replaced and integrated seven annual business surveys into one survey. The AIES provides the most comprehensive national and subnational data on business revenues, expenses, payroll, and employment on an annual basis. Data collection for the 2025 AIES began March 30, 2026.  aMerger of: Annual capital expenditures survey; Annual retail trade survey; Annual survey of manufactures (Integrating resource); Annual wholesale trade survey; Manufacturers' unfilled orders survey; Report of organization; and Service annual survey.0 aPage last revised September 4, 2026; title from web page (viewed Sept. 21, 2026). 0aEconomic surveyszUnited States. 0aIndustrial surveyszUnited States. 0aUnited StatesxEconomic conditionsvStatistics.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85140032 7aSurveys.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2026026017 7aStatistics.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf20140261812 aU.S. Census Bureau,eissuing body.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no200310060104tAnnual capital expenditures surveyw(DLC) 2026229190w(OCoLC)161891317604tAnnual retail trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229191w(OCoLC)161891842104tAnnual survey of manufacturersw(DLC) 2026229192w(OCoLC)161891892404tAnnual wholesale trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229193w(OCoLC)161892798704tManufacturers' unfilled orders (M3UFO) surveyw(DLC) 2026229194w(OCoLC)161893701304tReport of organizationw(DLC) 2026229195w(OCoLC)161893841604tService annual surveyw(DLC) 2026229196w(OCoLC)161893874940uhttps://purl.fdlp.gov/GPO/gpo260127704 zAddress at time of PURL creationuhttps://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/aies.html  aC0bGPO  abc72 20260928b20260928  aCONSERNEWb20260928  aUNREPORTEDPUBSASKGPOb20260928  aISSNREQb20260928  aVEND01b2026093001725nam a22003733a 00147997820260928161431.0m     o  d f      cr ||||||||||